secubox-mediaflow (2.2.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Discovered Media: collapse multi-part HLS streams (esp. video.twimg.com) to
    ONE reconstructed, fully-cloneable entry instead of flooding the list with
    hundreds of .m4s/.ts segments. Reconstruction prefers the master .m3u8
    (video+audio); when only variant playlists were seen, picks the highest-res
    video variant + an audio variant and muxes them with ffmpeg. New audio_url on
    clone jobs. UI shows kind=stream with a parts count. (#736)

