secubox-mediaflow (2.1.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * R4 Discovered Media + Clone (#736): new dashboard cards. /discovered reads
    the sbxmitm media-catch log; /clone enqueues a yt-dlp (or ffmpeg) download
    into a library; /library + /download/{id} serve the cloned files; delete
    supported. Clone worker is lazily (re)started per-request so it also runs
    under the aggregator (which skips sub-app lifespans).

